### Phase 2: Core Infrastructure

#### [NEW] Models (15 files in `lib/core/models/`)
- `auth_models.dart` - User, AuthResponse, Role, Permission, Organization, etc.
- `api_response.dart` - ApiResponse\<T\>, ApiErrorResponse
- `page_model.dart` - Page\<T\>, Pageable
- `job_model.dart`, `application_model.dart`, `candidate_model.dart`, `client_model.dart`, `project_model.dart`, `asset_model.dart`, `holiday_model.dart`, `payroll_model.dart`, `ticket_model.dart`, `resume_analysis_model.dart`, `public_models.dart`

#### [NEW] Dio Interceptors (5 files in `lib/core/interceptors/`)
- `auth_interceptor.dart` - Attach Bearer token to `/api` requests
- `loading_interceptor.dart` - Show/hide loading overlay, `X-Skip-Loading` header support
- `error_interceptor.dart` - Parse `ApiErrorResponse`, show snackbar with status-specific messages
- `success_interceptor.dart` - Show success snackbar for POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE responses
- `unauthorized_interceptor.dart` - Handle 403 with dialog

#### [NEW] Services (in `lib/core/services/`)
- `api_service.dart` - Dio-based HTTP client (get/post/put/patch/delete/download) matching Angular ApiService
- `auth_service.dart` - Login, refreshUser, registerVendor, logout
- `storage_service.dart` - Flutter Secure Storage wrapper
- Plus 20+ domain services matching Angular (job, candidate, application, etc.)

#### [NEW] Providers (in `lib/core/providers/`)
- `auth_provider.dart` - Riverpod `StateNotifier` matching AuthStore (user, tokens, role checks, viewRole simulation, storage persistence)
- `loading_provider.dart` - Active request counter
- `dialog_provider.dart` - Dialog state

#### [NEW] Router (in `lib/core/router/`)
- `app_router.dart` - GoRouter with all routes, redirect logic for auth/role guards
- `route_guards.dart` - authGuard, roleGuard redirect functions

---

### Phase 3: Shared Widgets

#### [NEW] Widgets (8 files in `lib/shared/widgets/`)
- `loading_modal.dart` - Full-screen loading overlay
- `app_dialog.dart` - Success/warning/error dialog matching Angular DialogComponent
- `confirm_modal.dart` - Confirmation dialog
- `user_avatar.dart` - Avatar with gradient background and initials
- `organization_logo.dart` - Org logo with fallback
- `notification_dropdown.dart` - Notification bell with badge and dropdown
- `timeline_widget.dart` - Vertical timeline component
- `chatbot_widget.dart` - Chatbot FAB

---

### Phase 4: Layout

#### [NEW] `lib/layout/main_layout.dart`
Scaffold with sidebar drawer (mobile) / fixed sidebar (tablet+), header, content area. Exact match of Angular MainLayoutComponent template.

#### [NEW] `lib/layout/sidebar.dart`
Role-based menu sections with collapsible groups, notification badges, active link highlighting. Exact match of 7 menu sections from Angular SidebarComponent.

#### [NEW] `lib/layout/header.dart`
Top bar with hamburger menu, breadcrumb, notification bell, user avatar, view-role switcher (admin only).

#### [NEW] `lib/layout/public_layout.dart`
Public website layout with navigation header and footer.

