### Phase 6: Feature Modules (17 modules, 40+ screens)

Each module follows the pattern:
```
features/<module>/
├── pages/           # Screen widgets
├── widgets/         # Module-specific widgets
└── <module>_service.dart  # (if not in core/services)
```

Key screens per module:
- **Dashboard**: `role_dashboard_page.dart` (role-based content switching)
